  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 54792dea90349e441aadcd4bf565b4c2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Customer
  customerName: Priscilla
  potionName: Dramatic Potion
  recipe: 0200000003000000i
  orderLines:
  - Ugh, FINALLY. I've been waiting forever! Listen, I need a potion that makes my hair and clothes flow dramatically whenever I enter a room. I simply CANNOT keep making entrances like a normal person. Do you have ANY idea how embarrassing that is? And please, make it FAST.
  happyLines:
  - '"OH. MY. GOD. IT''S PERFECT! LOOK AT ME! The hair, the breeze, the DRAMA! Everyone is going to be so jealous. Honestly, you''re lucky I''m even letting you make potions for me. Ta-ta, darling!'
  angryLines:
  - EXCUSE ME?! What on EARTH is this?! I specifically asked for a DRAMATIC ENTRANCE, not this absolute DISGRACE! Do you have ANY idea how much time I've wasted coming all the way here?! Unbelievable. I'm NEVER coming back!
