  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Customer
  customerName: Winnie
  potionName: Productivity Potion
  recipe: 0100000004000000i
  orderLines:
  - Okay, so I have about a million chores to do, and honestly... I just don't feel like doing any of them. Could you make something that'll do all my work for me? I'd really appreciate it. My bed misses me.
  happyLines:
  - IT WORKED! LOOK AT THEM GO! Finally, someone else can do my chores while I do absolutely nothing. This is the greatest day of my life!
  angryLines:
  - Wait... so you're telling me I still have to do everything myself? Oh, this is terrible. I might actually have to become a responsible person.
